    {
      "id": "2064476609667600721",
      "text": "made an entire video ad for my app without a camera, a creator, or leaving my chair\n\n@arcads took just 7 minutes to create\n\ni selected from one of the premade characters ( 1 min )\n\npasted the script made with claude \n( 2 min ) \n\ntweaked around with the tone ( 1 min )\n\nhit render ( 3 min ) \nnow i have an ad ready to test, wild",
      "author": {
        "id": "1905855400148168704",
        "name": "Jah Mills",
        "screenName": "itsjahmills",
        "profileImageUrl": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1980148997378478080/tUD9XHv1_normal.jpg",
        "verified": true
      },
      "metrics": {
        "likes": 9,
        "retweets": 0,
        "replies": 1,
        "quotes": 1,
        "views": 2123,
        "bookmarks": 7
      },
      "createdAt": "Tue Jun 09 22:35:54 +0000 2026",
      "createdAtLocal": "2026-06-10 06:35",
      "createdAtISO": "2026-06-09T22:35:54+00:00",
      "media": [
        {
          "type": "video",
          "url": "https://video.twimg.com/amplify_video/2064476424157728768/vid/avc1/1080x1920/x8wE46Qpzy5BG_A9.mp4?tag=27",
          "width": 1080,
          "height": 1920
        }
      ],
      "urls": [],
      "isRetweet": false,
      "retweetedBy": null,
      "lang": "en",
      "score": null,
      "quotedTweet": {
        "id": "2063647630509355420",
        "text": "i just risked my life and phone to record this\nad for my app but it was definitely worth it \n\na complete app demo within just 13 seconds 1,000+ ft up in the air as the visual hook\n\ni’m testing a few different text hooks, between the 2 below\n\nwhich one do you think will get more views\nand which one do you suggest i also test\n\n2 days ago i perfected the entire app fully\nusing only Rork Max + Opus 4.8\n\n i won’t need to touch up the app again\nfor at least a few months \n\nand yesterday we created 20 more videos to post these following days \n\nthe next couple months are crystal clear \n\n> post 20-30x a day \n> repeat what works\n> cut the losers quick\n> test new concepts weekly\n> hire UGC to replicate winning content\n ( 10 ppl posting twice a day )\n> run paid ads on winning creatives\n\nit’s simple but it takes a lot of time",
        "author": {
          "screenName": "itsjahmills",
          "name": "Jah Mills"
        }
      }
    },
