      "id": "2064271313544372709",
      "text": "I am very intrigued \n\nI remember you once said your screenshots are made with Claude design, Codex and photoshop. Are you saving a template for them?\n\nI ask because I have noticed Codex being the best at generating images, but I don’t achieve any consistency with it, it makes different size device frames with each image\n\nBut I notice yours are all consistent throughout; device frame and layout, the elements layout, everything. Curious on your workflow to achieve that consistency",
