      "id": "2064554640809791915",
      "text": "Workflow between Davenport Files and Firefly Boards:\n\n1. Open Finder window, drag and drop files into Files\n2. Pin Files window to top, go Narrow Mode\n3. Drag and drop files from Files to Firefly Boards.\n\nThis build made with:\n\nClaude Fable\nAdobe Firefly Boards\n\n#AdobeFireflyBoards #FireflyBoards #ClaudeCode #Claude #Fable #VibeCoding",
      "author": {
        "id": "1453855060073410563",
