        "text": "This is literally a serious pain point and an app I needed. My first real test of this will be to organize my working files that I’ve made with Runway and other apps. (Drag and drop from Downloads folder to Davenport.) \n\nI also have a nice Davenport-to-Adobe Firefly Boards workflow going.",
